    "en": [
      "The image shows the back of a postcard with handwritten text in blue and black ink. The handwriting is in Romanian. There is a rectangular stamp impression that reads 'MUZEUL J.D. Bv.' The postcard is not divided for address and message, which is typical for older European postcards. There is no visible photograph or illustration, only text."
